# Shared environment for pi, loaded by extensions/00-env.ts before any other
# extension. Tracked in the ~/.pi repo: non-secret switches only. Per-machine
# values and secrets go in ~/.pi/agent/.env, which is never synced. A variable
# already exported in your shell wins over both files.
PI_DIET=off
#
# Shared switches:
# PI_DIET=off — disable prompt-diet rewrites (stale against current pi tool text)
# PI_DIET=dump — dump originals to prompt-diet.dump.json instead of rewriting
